WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:02.970
Queen's Blade.

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:09.450
This is a ritual of the gods, used to decide the strongest and most beautiful Queen.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.580
The one who is worthy to be Queen...

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.820
This is something that won't be determined until they fight.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.550
It's strange, isn't it? Relaxing in a place like this...

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.580
It's not strange at all! Hurry up and eat your ice cream.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.570
Delicious!

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.930
What is up with that outfit, Shizuka-san?

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.430
It's for the sake of understanding the mainland culture.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:44.770
Even so...

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.540
Think about my mission... I must uphold my honor.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.690
We cannot afford distractions.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.960
You're too uptight.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:54.990
I know!

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:57.220
You should change your clothes too, Tomoe-sama!

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:57.920
Eh?

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:02.160
Learning from your enemies will definitely benefit Hinomoto!

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.040
You're probably right, but...

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.990
When in Rome, do as the Romans do.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:10.040
Tomoe-sama!

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:16.970
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:16.970
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:16.970
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:25.690
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:25.690
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:25.690
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:41.690
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:41.690
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:41.690
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:48.210
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:48.210
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:48.210
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:53.880
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:53.880
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:53.880
It is now my wish to become strong

00:01:54.840 --> 00:02:00.510
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:01:54.840 --> 00:02:00.510
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:01:54.840 --> 00:02:00.510
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:06.680
kotae wo shiritai

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:06.680
答えを知りたい

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:06.680
I want to know the answer

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:13.570
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:13.570
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:13.570
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:19.820
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:19.820
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:19.820
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:26.000
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:26.000
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:26.000
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:36.100
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:36.100
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:36.100
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.920
H-How does it look?

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.750
Still not there.

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:50.540
This is a little...

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.880
That doesn't suit you at all!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.210
Eh?

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.440
How am I going to protect Hinomoto wearing this?

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.570
That has nothing to do with this!

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.870
Let's stop this already!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.670
Attention, all participants of the Queen's Blade competition:

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:11.540
Let everything be explained with battle here and now!

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:22.830
This is...

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:27.930
Yes. This is Queen's Blade, Tomoe-sama.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.060
Wow!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.430
Just a second! They've gotten ahead of Nanael again!

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:39.320
Even though I was the one who found the participants for Queen's Blade!

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:50.290
This is where...

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.390
What are you doing?

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:57.420
Hurry up and come over here!

00:03:58.950 --> 00:03:59.630
Okay.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.470
Wow, so that's the border.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:11.430
The entrance to the Queen's lands.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.200
It looks like Claudette has yet to return here.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:17.830
Eh?

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.850
Her surname's banner isn't up, right?

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.180
You're right.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.450
Well then, I've led you here like I was asked.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.900
I wonder if everything will go well?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.620
Why don't we test your luck?

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:33.370
If it's heads, luck is on our side.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.170
Looks like we're lucky!

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.430
Hold on!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.280
It's the same on both sides!

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.720
Isn't it interesting? It's a nice trick!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.170
More like a prank.

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.760
Take it, it might come in handy.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.210
I'm fine without it.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.850
I don't need money from a thief.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:02.720
The nature of money depends solely on how it's used.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.880
In a way, that coin is a reflection of yourself.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.370
This is the wisdom of a chivalrous thief.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.740
You'd do well to remember it.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.980
Don't you get it?

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.870
When you take control of your life, I'll be taking it back from you.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.410
Geez... Stop making fun of me, already.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.010
I'm not!

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:21.520
Well, let's go! To the border!

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:32.010
This is Leina Bansu, the future Countess!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.520
Why are you stopping us?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.720
Just a moment. I'll be back shortly.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:40.980
You think you can just say "Bansu" and everything will go your way?

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.680
Don't be afraid.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.690
Y-Yeah.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:46.900
Those underlings can't lay a hand on you.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.450
As long as Claudette isn't here, everything will be fine.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.560
What are you doing? Let's go!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.370
Hold on!

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.870
The bird has left its cage?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.640
Sorry that you're doing this just for my sake...

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:06.330
As I recall, the Count's order was to bring Leina back.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.550
Why are you letting her run around?

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.590
I have a plan.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.150
Unless you have any specific directives?

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.850
No, not anything specific...

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:16.100
I am the veteran mercenary, Echidna.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:21.040
I've accepted the request, but I'll cook things up the way I like.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.050
Cook, you say?

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.610
It looks like I've come across a tasty little bird.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.750
That idiot...

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:34.450
We did it! I've finally left the Count's castle.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.990
You're just like a child.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:38.830
Thanks, Risty. It's all because of you.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:39.840
I know, right?

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:48.130
Ah, I'm so tired.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.760
We can rest here for the day.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.720
Well, let's go.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:53.180
Eh?

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.890
Look, look!

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.100
It's a tasty fruit!

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:00.510
Risty.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:02.020
Here!

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:07.660
It's better to choose the smaller ones while you're traveling.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.020
There's no meaning in tiring yourself out, right?

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:13.120
It was just so delicious looking...

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:13.610
What a shame.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:14.950
Here.

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:17.620
Dried meat. This is your best bet.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.700
Hmm?

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:22.870
How about this?

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:23.580
No.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.790
Eh?

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:28.800
It's white and protects you from the heat, and is light and easy to move around in.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.130
And it's cute.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.140
You would be spotted by the enemy too easily.

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.940
This is kind of hard...

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:36.800
Well, at least you're thinking about it.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.570
At any rate, everything is going well because of my amazing self!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.900
Yeah, that's right.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:52.950
You've been set free, and with that promise fulfilled, I worked off the money you gave me.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.810
Yes, thanks.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.910
Risty, where are you headed from here?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.200
I'm setting off directly for the Queen's capital to the west!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.660
But that wouldn't be interesting at all...

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.550
Maybe I'll go to the desert and take a look at the ancient ruins of Amar?

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:07.670
The Amar ruins?

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:12.050
I've heard that the cursed spirit of a ruler haunts that place!

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.510
It sounds scary, but fun!

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:21.970
Risty? I can't just keep following you, can I?

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:23.930
No, you can't.

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:26.150
From now on, we both follow our own paths.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.230
That's what we promised.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:31.290
Yeah... that's right...

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.010
Maybe we'll meet up again during our travels.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:01.720
Here. I'll pay for the inn expenses before I go.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:06.050
It's not here!

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.180
The money is gone!

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:07.810
Eh?

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.020
There was a woman who just left!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.730
Shit! That snake!

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.580
Taking our money like that...

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.200
Unforgivable!

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:29.900
That money is something she managed to obtain.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.040
It was stolen because I was careless.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:34.760
Risty...

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.970
It seems that this shop becomes a gambling den at night.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.670
A gambling den?

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.750
In other words, this place is a gold mine!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.180
You can't steal anything!

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.070
If we don't have money, we won't be able to get out of here.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:46.980
Our journey will be over.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.860
That's why we should work together...

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:57.670
What's this?

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.850
A betting competition.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:00.700
We can get money from it, right?

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.280
Yeah.

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.310
I'll enter this!

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:05.240
Risty, promise me.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:05.910
Huh?

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:10.330
If I win the money, we'll continue to travel together.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.790
This isn't embarrassing...

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:27.350
Not at all!

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:31.690
You've got a nice body, newcomer!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.110
She has great tits!

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:36.690
Yeah, and look at that ass!

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.610
I will win, and earn my keep!

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.010
Are you worried...

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.160
about that girl?

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.540
You're that person from earlier...

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.330
Come on, newcomer!

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:04.250
I don't have any more money.
There's nothing more you can take.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.970
I wonder what you're talking about?

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:08.640
I have no intention of playing games with you.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.630
Go somewhere else.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.020
Ah! How straightforward.

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:17.440
Or maybe the money here has piqued your interest?

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:20.940
Chivalrous thief of the wasteland, Risty.

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.340
How dare you!

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:45.760
<i>I will win!</i>

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:48.990
That's a lot of money.

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:49.930
Really nice.

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:52.350
These are only the seeds.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.440
Tonight, there will be ten times as much.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.520
So then? What do I have to do?

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.360
It's nice that you get straight to the point.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:06.010
All I need is the heiress to the Bansu family.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.870
Did you see that, Risty?

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.650
I won the money, just like I promised.

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:17.790
I didn't make that promise.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:21.630
Besides, five gold coins isn't enough at all.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:28.090
It may take as many as 100 gold coins.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:31.680
It seems that there are even bigger rewards late at night.

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:32.620
I...

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:33.770
The decision is yours.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:36.980
I'll do it.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:38.690
I'll show you I can win.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.020
Well said.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:44.860
Risty-sama, the chivalrous thief,
will give you another piece of wisdom.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:46.450
Wisdom?

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.730
Run away before you die.

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.110
Understood?

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.990
This is the wisest choice in battle.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:54.610
I already know that.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.010
That's fine, then.

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:57.670
Good luck.

00:12:58.700 --> 00:12:59.750
Risty!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.630
Here's a coin for the participation fee.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.330
I will definitely have you return this coin to me.

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:13.660
Really so cute!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.610
Oil?

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.660
Thanks for waiting!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:35.450
The next challenger is Leina!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:38.920
She's a newcomer who just arrived today!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:43.760
On the other hand, her opponent is rumored to be invincible!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:46.090
Echidna!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.760
<i>Echidna, she looks strong.</i>

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.050
<i>Can I really win?</i>

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:55.090
<i>But I've come this far and done well.</i>

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.430
<i>I'll definitely win!</i>

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:59.810
You are amazingly cute.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.800
Get up!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.660
Hurry up!

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:19.740
Here.

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:24.540
Thank you.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.130
Stupid girl.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.970
Yeah, just like that, such a nice face!

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.430
Well then?

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:55.580
What are you going to do next?

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.750
Now, let's get started!

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:11.010
How's this?

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.380
It hurts.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:15.890
So it pleases you?

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.640
I'm so happy!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.430
Hurry up and finish her!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.420
Yeah, just do it already!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:26.480
Stop being so slow about it!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.320
Hurry and get out of here.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.650
You barbaric men should just disappear!

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.150
Shut up!

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:38.660
As if we need this shop, anyway!

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:42.580
Sorry for the wait.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:54.550
I'm sorry.

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:05.770
I was hired by count Bansu to capture Leina.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:09.010
And, you see... I'd like to cooperate wth you.

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:09.860
Cooperate?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:14.450
Something is about to happen in this shop. When it does, you need to leave.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.560
Hmm?

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:17.620
And the settlement is?

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:20.180
All of tonight's winnings.

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.410
As much as you want.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:39.540
I've found a lucky coin!

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.310
It's a different one?

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Leave it to me!</i>

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.730
<i>I'll see to all the journey's expenses!</i>

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.930
It's been fun, Leina.

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:52.150
I'm sure that you will have good fortune, too.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:57.310
It's been a long time since I've been so excited.

00:16:57.310 --> 00:17:00.660
You have a wonderful face and such a nice body!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:04.660
Don't mock me!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.320
Kenta!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.710
You can't get enough of it, either?

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:19.970
Not there!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.180
I'd love if you resisted some more.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:23.620
Ah!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.480
Kenta, that's enough.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.900
Are you going to admit defeat?

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.860
If you do, I'll give you the antidote.

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:19.860
If you don't hurry, the poison will spread throughout your body.

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:22.090
I.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:25.490
I wonder if I'm going to die like this?

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.560
It's frustrating.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.730
I wanted more... I wanted to be stronger.

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.870
You're so cute. I'm shivering with excitement.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:39.050
You're like a bird with burnt wings.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:43.180
Even though you can no longer fly, you're trying your best.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:44.410
I can't bear it.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.600
It's okay to cry if you want to let it out!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.050
I think... I played with her a little too long.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:13.000
Ah, I'm burning!

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:15.760
I like you, Leina.

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:19.670
It's too soon to be returning you to the Count.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:30.470
<i>I'm alive?</i>

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.810
<i>I have to go back.</i>

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:35.670
<i>Risty is waiting for me.</i>

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:36.800
<i>Risty is...</i>

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.860
Risty, I'm back!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.930
In the end, I lost.

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:56.130
Risty?

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.200
That's right.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.880
Someone like me...

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:06.720
won't be able to help you on your journey.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.510
I was left behind, too.

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:25.450
Leina!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:53.210
<i>When you take control of your life, I'll be taking this coin back from you.</i>

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:54.980
Risty!

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:01.190
<i>I'll show you that I can catch up to you.</i>

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.080
<i>No matter what!</i>

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.120
Let's find somewhere to rest, Tomoe-sama.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.290
There is no inn out here, so stop your whining.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:23.920
That looks good on you.

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:28.310
I decided myself that these clothes were the best choice!

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.890
So then, where are we going to from here?

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.930
Of course.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.180
We are aiming for the Queen's capital!

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuru

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
I can't express my overflowing feelings well.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
itsuka konna mainichi ga

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
いつかこんな毎日が

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
Until one day, when this every day life

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
natsukashiku naru hi ga kuru made wa

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
懐かしくなる日が来るまでは

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
Becomes a memory I would look back at

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
itsumo kokoro no katasumi ni

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
いつも心の片隅に

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
I would like to keep it locked away

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
shizuka ni shimatte okitai

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
静かにしまっておきたい

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
In the quiet corner of my heart.

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
yakusoku nante chiisa na ki yasume

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
約束なんて小さな気休め

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
Promises are but consolations.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
ashita o mukaeru tame ni tsuita

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
明日を迎えるためについた

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
They may very well be,

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
yasashii uso kamoshirenai

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
優しい嘘かもしれない

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
Simple lies to face tomorrow.

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
shinjiteru kara ano hi no koto

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
信じてるからあの日のこと

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
I'll continue to believe in the day we made our promise,

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
donna ni jikan ga tattemo

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
どんなに時間が経っても

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
No matter how much time passes by,

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
ima no watashi wo sasaeteru taisetsu na mono

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
今の私を支えてる大切なもの

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
It is my wish to tell you everything.

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:16.570
I am the glorious angel Nanael!

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:21.040
I wanted to have more participants than this, but nothing is going as planned!

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:23.540
Besides that, why did they use oil?

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:26.890
That's not the proper way to fight in Queen's Blade!

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:28.040
I want to hit something!

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:31.360
If it comes to this, I'll show you! I swear I will show you!

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:32.720
Just you watch!

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:36.470
I will definitely spread this competition across the world!

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:38.780
Next time: Rivalry ~ The Lightning General!

00:23:38.780 --> 00:23:42.060
Let everything be explained with battle!
